chala pyaase gale par kund khanjar<br>
sada zainab ne di ye rabb e dawar<br>
<br>
aye jaan e fatima o murtuza <br>
huwe ghurbat me tum jo hamse juda <br>
kaha zainab ne apna peet ke sar<br>
<br>
sar e maqtal hai zehra ka dulara <br>
hazaro'n hai'n adu shabbir tanha <br>
hai ek mazloom, har janib sitamgar<br>
<br>
akela ran me hai zehra ka pyaara <br>
na koi saya na koi sahara <br>
taras khata nahi koi bhi uspar<br>
<br>
madad ka waqt hai abbas aao <br>
utho darya se bhai ko bachao <br>
na so yu'n chain se shaane kata kar<br>
<br>
jo teri yaad me roye sakina <br>
jo maqtal me tujhe dhoonde sakina <br>
dilasa du'n usey akhir mai kyu'nkar<br>
<br>
gire ghode se ran me ibne hyder <br>
ali rote hain girya hai payambar <br>
zibha karne ko jaate hai sitamgar<br>
<br>
behan qaime me ab tum laut jao <br>
abhi zinda hoo'n na aansu bahao <br>
kaha sheh ne ye sar sajde me rakh kar<br>
<br>
qayamat laayi hai shame gharibaa'n <br>
haram ka ab nahi koi nighebaa'n <br>
labo'n pe sab ke hai nouha ye anwar